Package: mica-mqttd
Version: 0.0.1-1
Source-Date-Epoch: 1792368000
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: mica build <mica@example.invalid>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: passwd, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Mica OS MQTT application-data bridge
 Publishes the item trees of enrolled com.mica.* applications to MQTT and,
 in full mode, carries writes back. Carries a systemd unit and an OpenRC
 script and enables neither: micad starts it when MQTT is enabled, after
 writing its configuration.
